-# The LLVM Compiler Infrastructure
-
-[![OpenSSF Scorecard](https://api.securityscorecards.dev/projects/github.com/llvm/llvm-project/badge)](https://securityscorecards.dev/viewer/?uri=github.com/llvm/llvm-project)
